OL,4,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,5,     GLive from Tewkesbury Abbey, with
OL,6,     Gmusic by Durufle, Bob Chilcott,
OL,7,     GFinzi and Widor.
OL,8,G1600FComposer of the Week: Arthur Bliss
OL,9,     GDonald Macleod with guest
OL,10,     Gbiographer Paul Spicer explore
OL,11,     Gthe early years of marriage for
OL,12,     GBliss, including his
OL,13,     Gcollaborations with the BBC.
OL,14,G1700FIn Tune
OL,15,     GKatie Derham with live music in
OL,16,     Gthe studio from Owain Park and
OL,17,     GThe Gesualdo Six, and violinist
OL,18,     GAlina Ibragimova talks about her
OL,19,     Gnew album.
