OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 3 JUN
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,7,     Gfavourites.
OL,8,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,9,     GAs part of Wigmore Hall's 125th
OL,10,     GAnniversary Festival, the Belcea
OL,11,     GQuartet are joined by viola
OL,12,     Gplayer Tabea Zimmermann in string
OL,13,     Gquintets by Mozart and Brahms.
OL,14,G2145FThe Essay: The Other
OL,15,     FShostakoviches
OL,16,     GChris Addison tries to make sense
OL,17,     Gof the brutal, strange music of
OL,18,     GGalina Ustvolskaya - music that
OL,19,     Gexplores the very extremes of
OL,20,     Gmusic-making yet has a powerfully
OL,21,     Gspiritual quality.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
